  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\n$\\frac{d y}{d x}=2 a x+b$\r\nat $(1,1) \\frac{d y}{d x}=2 a+b=1$  ...(1)\r\nNow $(1,1)$ and $(-1,0)$ satisfies the curve\r\n$a-b+c=0$ ...(2)\r\n$a+b+c=1$ ...(3)\r\n$\\mathrm{b}=\\frac{1}{2} ; \\mathrm{a}=\\frac{1}{4} ; \\mathrm{c}=\\frac{1}{4}$",
